<title>USA: Horseshoe Gaming to issue $145 mln in 10-yr debt.</title>
<headline>Horseshoe Gaming to issue $145 mln in 10-yr debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horseshoe Gaming L.L.C. is expected to issue $145 million in 10-year 144A senior subordinated debt on Wednesday via sole manager Wasserstein Perella Securities Inc (Grantchester Securities), according to high-yield market sources.</p>
<p>The deal, rated B2/single-B, is seen pricing to yield 275 basis points to 300 basis points over Treasuries, a buyside source said.</p>
<p>Horseshoe Gaming operates casinos in Bossier City, Louisiana, and Tunica, Mississipi.</p>
<p>((--Al Yoon, 212-859-1672))</p>
